  ],
  "duration_s": 412.517241,
  "text_source": "FunASR转录，未全量逐字听核；时间为模型估计",
  "core_text": "美国关了他整整五年，他瘦了三十斤，靠一封，夹带着求救信，回到了祖国家人们。今天讲一件让所有中国人心里发烫的往事。一九五零年，美国洛杉矶，一个中国人订好了船票，打包好了全部行李，准备带着妻子孩子回国。他在美国是什么地位？世界顶尖的空气动力学专家，美国国海军和空军的座上宾，手里攥着最高级别的保密许可。可就在他要上船的时候，海关把他拦下了，行李被扣了，人被带走了。理由是什么？莫须有怀疑他携带机密材料，他被关进了太平洋上的一个小岛，拘留所一关就是十五天。那十五天，美国人不让他睡觉，每隔一会儿就把他叫醒。一次轮番审问，软硬兼施家人们，您能想象吗？一个人被剥夺睡眠，反复折磨，是什么滋味？等他被放出来的时候，整个人暴瘦了，大概三十斤。后来是他的老师冯卡门，还有一帮美国科学家凑了一万五千美元才把他保了出来。可出了拘留所就自由了吗？没有。从此，他过上了长达五年的软禁生活。电话被监听，信件被拆看家门口永远停着监视的车。他走到哪儿，美国人都盯着美国人，为什么这么怕他？美国海军司长金布尔说过一句著名的话，我宁可把他毙了也不能让他离开美国，他无论走到哪里都抵得上五个师。五个师啊家人们，美国人是懂价值的。可美国人不知道的是，他们关得住钱学森的人关不住，钱学森的心被软禁的那五年，他做了两件事，第一写的一本书叫工程控制论。这本书直接开创了一门新学科，直到今天，全世界的工程师还在读第二。他一直在想一件事，怎么才能联系上祖国？信写不了信会被检查，电话打不了，会被监听怎么办？一九五五年的一天，钱学森在报纸上看到了一个名字，陈书通一位德高望重的老人，他小时候跟着父亲去拜访过。钱学森，心里一动，提笔写了一封信，信上写着我准备归国，但美国处处阻挠，请求祖国帮助。信写好了怎么寄出去？这时候，他的夫人蒋英站了出来，蒋英是谁？著名歌唱家，他的父亲是民国著名军事家蒋百里，这位出身名门的女子，做了一件让后来无数人泪目的事，他用左手模仿小孩歪歪扭扭的笔迹，把信封写好，然后把那封求救信夹在了一封给妹妹的家书里。既往比利时妹妹一看就明白了，立刻转继回祖国。这封信一路辗转，最后摆在了周总理的办公桌上家人们，您知道这封信有多重要吗？那会儿，中美正在日内瓦谈判，美国想换回十一个被俘的美军飞行员，嘴上却硬的很，说钱学森是自愿留在美国的中方代表当场把信拿出来，白纸黑字，铁证如山，美国人的脸当场就挂不住了。最后双方达成交换十一个美军飞行员，换一个钱学森家人们，您算算这笔账，十一个飞行员换一个人，美国人心疼的是一个兵。可他们换出去的是谁？是抵得上五个师的钱学森。后来有美国人自己都承认，这笔买卖是他们在冷战里做过的最亏本的交易之一。一九五五年九月十七号，钱学森终于登上了回国的轮船，克利夫兰总统号船。经过日本横滨码头上，有人再三劝他下去逛逛嘛，买点土特产，钱学森一步都没有下船。据后来披露。组织上早就提前以他父亲的名义发来电报，叮嘱他沿途切勿下船。为什么？因为一旦踏上日本的土地，就什么意外都可能发生，而美国人可以说跟我们没关系。就这样，这艘船载着全中国最值钱的一个头脑，破浪向西。一九五五年十月八号，钱学森踏上祖国土地的那一刻，迎接他的是罗湖桥上的五星红旗。他后来回忆说，看到国旗那一刻，眼泪差点没绷住。家人们，您想想，那段日子，他被关了五年，瘦了三十斤受尽折磨，可他一句怨言都没有蒋英。后来回忆说，那五年，他甚至做好了最坏的打算，但但他们始终相信，祖国一定会接他回家。事实证明，他们赌赢了，而中国赢回了自己的未来。有一句话说的好，有些历史我们不该忘，也不能忘。钱学森用五年自由换回了中国航天整整一个时代。今天的神州嫦娥天问、东风快递，所有的根都从他一九五五年迈上罗浮桥那一刻开始，家人们点个关注，下期我接着讲钱老回国之后的故事。这条视频请您一定点赞、收藏、转发，让更多人知道，当年有一个中国人用一封藏在信封里的求救信救回了自己的祖国。",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c8d5125464df0e61_s00001",
      "start_ms": 130,
      "end_ms": 1890,
      "text": "美国关了他整整五年，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c8d5125464df0e61_s00002",
      "start_ms": 2310,
      "end_ms": 3510,
      "text": "他瘦了三十斤，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c8d5125464df0e61_s00003",
      "start_ms": 3790,
      "end_ms": 4470,
      "text": "靠一封，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c8d5125464df0e61_s00004",
      "start_ms": 4650,
      "end_ms": 5910,
      "text": "夹带着求救信，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c8d5125464df0e61_s00005",
      "start_ms": 6190,
      "end_ms": 8470,
      "text": "回到了祖国家人们。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c8d5125464df0e61_s00006",
      "start_ms": 8770,
      "end_ms": 12970,
      "text": "今天讲一件让所有中国人心里发烫的往事。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c8d5125464df0e61_s00007",
      "start_ms": 13730,
      "end_ms": 14770,
      "text": "一九五零年，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c8d5125464df0e61_s00008",
      "start_ms": 14950,
      "end_ms": 16190,
      "text": "美国洛杉矶，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c8d5125464df0e61_s00009",
      "start_ms": 16730,
      "end_ms": 18650,
      "text": "一个中国人订好了船票，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c8d5125464df0e61_s00010",
      "start_ms": 19270,
      "end_ms": 20990,
      "text": "打包好了全部行李，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c8d5125464df0e61_s00011",
      "start_ms": 21290,
      "end_ms": 23430,
      "text": "准备带着妻子孩子回国。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c8d5125464df0e61_s00012",
      "start_ms": 24030,
      "end_ms": 25770,
      "text": "他在美国是什么地位？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c8d5125464df0e61_s00013",
      "start_ms": 26170,
      "end_ms": 29310,
      "text": "世界顶尖的空气动力学专家，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c8d5125464df0e61_s00014",
      "start_ms": 29670,
      "end_ms": 32320,
      "text": "美国国海军和空军的座上宾，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c8d5125464df0e61_s00015",
      "start_ms": 32760,
      "end_ms": 35320,
      "text": "手里攥着最高级别的保密许可。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c8d5125464df0e61_s00016",
      "start_ms": 35800,
      "end_ms": 37700,
      "text": "可就在他要上船的时候，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c8d5125464df0e61_s00017",
      "start_ms": 37880,
      "end_ms": 39340,
      "text": "海关把他拦下了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c8d5125464df0e61_s00018",
      "start_ms": 39440,
      "end_ms": 40400,
      "text": "行李被扣了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c8d5125464df0e61_s00019",
      "start_ms": 40420,
      "end_ms": 41960,
      "text": "人被带走了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c8d5125464df0e61_s00020",
      "start_ms": 43300,
      "end_ms": 44240,
      "text": "理由是什么？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c8d5125464df0e61_s00021",
      "start_ms": 44580,
      "end_ms": 48000,
      "text": "莫须有怀疑他携带机密材料，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c8d5125464df0e61_s00022",
      "start_ms": 48700,
      "end_ms": 51080,
      "text": "他被关进了太平洋上的一个小岛，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c8d5125464df0e61_s00023",
      "start_ms": 51080,
      "end_ms": 53920,
      "text": "拘留所一关就是十五天。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c8d5125464df0e61_s00024",
      "start_ms": 54400,
      "end_ms": 55240,
      "text": "那十五天，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c8d5125464df0e61_s00025",
      "start_ms": 55800,
      "end_ms": 57340,
      "text": "美国人不让他睡觉，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c8d5125464df0e61_s00026",
      "start_ms": 57680,
      "end_ms": 59080,
      "text": "每隔一会儿就把他叫醒。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c8d5125464df0e61_s00027",
      "start_ms": 59120,
      "end_ms": 61060,
      "text": "一次轮番审问，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c8d5125464df0e61_s00028",
      "start_ms": 61340,
      "end_ms": 63685,
      "text": "软硬兼施家人们，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c8d5125464df0e61_s00029",
      "start_ms": 64930,
      "end_ms": 65965,
      "text": "您能想象吗？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c8d5125464df0e61_s00030",
      "start_ms": 67050,
      "end_ms": 68730,
      "text": "一个人被剥夺睡眠，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c8d5125464df0e61_s00031",
      "start_ms": 69010,
      "end_ms": 70210,
      "text": "反复折磨，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c8d5125464df0e61_s00032",
      "start_ms": 70630,
      "end_ms": 71535,
      "text": "是什么滋味？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c8d5125464df0e61_s00033",
      "start_ms": 72330,
      "end_ms": 73810,
      "text": "等他被放出来的时候，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c8d5125464df0e61_s00034",
      "start_ms": 74110,
      "end_ms": 75430,
      "text": "整个人暴瘦了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c8d5125464df0e61_s00035",
      "start_ms": 75430,
      "end_ms": 76495,
      "text": "大概三十斤。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c8d5125464df0e61_s00036",
      "start_ms": 76970,
      "end_ms": 80045,
      "text": "后来是他的老师冯卡门，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c8d5125464df0e61_s00037",
      "start_ms": 80390,
      "end_ms": 84965,
      "text": "还有一帮美国科学家凑了一万五千美元才把他保了出来。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c8d5125464df0e61_s00038",
      "start_ms": 85590,
      "end_ms": 87920,
      "text": "可出了拘留所就自由了吗？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c8d5125464df0e61_s00039",
      "start_ms": 88040,
      "end_ms": 88585,
      "text": "没有。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c8d5125464df0e61_s00040",
      "start_ms": 89040,
      "end_ms": 89665,
      "text": "从此，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c8d5125464df0e61_s00041",
      "start_ms": 89950,
      "end_ms": 93565,
      "text": "他过上了长达五年的软禁生活。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c8d5125464df0e61_s00042",
      "start_ms": 93980,
      "end_ms": 95105,
      "text": "电话被监听，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c8d5125464df0e61_s00043",
      "start_ms": 95470,
      "end_ms": 99435,
      "text": "信件被拆看家门口永远停着监视的车。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c8d5125464df0e61_s00044",
      "start_ms": 100240,
      "end_ms": 100995,
      "text": "他走到哪儿，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c8d5125464df0e61_s00045",
      "start_ms": 101270,
      "end_ms": 103090,
      "text": "美国人都盯着美国人，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c8d5125464df0e61_s00046",
      "start_ms": 103090,
      "end_ms": 104065,
      "text": "为什么这么怕他？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c8d5125464df0e61_s00047",
      "start_ms": 104680,
      "end_ms": 107815,
      "text": "美国海军司长金布尔说过一句著名的话，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c8d5125464df0e61_s00048",
      "start_ms": 108280,
      "end_ms": 111445,
      "text": "我宁可把他毙了也不能让他离开美国，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c8d5125464df0e61_s00049",
      "start_ms": 111870,
      "end_ms": 114795,
      "text": "他无论走到哪里都抵得上五个师。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c8d5125464df0e61_s00050",
      "start_ms": 115480,
      "end_ms": 116945,
      "text": "五个师啊家人们，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c8d5125464df0e61_s00051",
      "start_ms": 117470,
      "end_ms": 118925,
      "text": "美国人是懂价值的。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c8d5125464df0e61_s00052",
      "start_ms": 119250,
      "end_ms": 120785,
      "text": "可美国人不知道的是，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c8d5125464df0e61_s00053",
      "start_ms": 121110,
      "end_ms": 125230,
      "text": "他们关得住钱学森的人关不住，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c8d5125464df0e61_s00054",
      "start_ms": 125230,
      "end_ms": 128415,
      "text": "钱学森的心被软禁的那五年，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c8d5125464df0e61_s00055",
      "start_ms": 128710,
      "end_ms": 129845,
      "text": "他做了两件事，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c8d5125464df0e61_s00056",
      "start_ms": 130150,
      "end_ms": 133605,
      "text": "第一写的一本书叫工程控制论。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c8d5125464df0e61_s00057",
      "start_ms": 134110,
      "end_ms": 136925,
      "text": "这本书直接开创了一门新学科，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c8d5125464df0e61_s00058",
      "start_ms": 137620,
      "end_ms": 138665,
      "text": "直到今天，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c8d5125464df0e61_s00059",
      "start_ms": 139050,
      "end_ms": 142190,
      "text": "全世界的工程师还在读第二。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c8d5125464df0e61_s00060",
      "start_ms": 142850,
      "end_ms": 144365,
      "text": "他一直在想一件事，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c8d5125464df0e61_s00061",
      "start_ms": 145230,
      "end_ms": 147615,
      "text": "怎么才能联系上祖国？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c8d5125464df0e61_s00062",
      "start_ms": 148460,
      "end_ms": 150970,
      "text": "信写不了信会被检查，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c8d5125464df0e61_s00063",
      "start_ms": 151250,
      "end_ms": 152270,
      "text": "电话打不了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c8d5125464df0e61_s00064",
      "start_ms": 152450,
      "end_ms": 154875,
      "text": "会被监听怎么办？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c8d5125464df0e61_s00065",
      "start_ms": 155890,
      "end_ms": 157385,
      "text": "一九五五年的一天，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c8d5125464df0e61_s00066",
      "start_ms": 157760,
      "end_ms": 160555,
      "text": "钱学森在报纸上看到了一个名字，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c8d5125464df0e61_s00067",
      "start_ms": 160790,
      "end_ms": 164495,
      "text": "陈书通一位德高望重的老人，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c8d5125464df0e61_s00068",
      "start_ms": 164950,
      "end_ms": 167025,
      "text": "他小时候跟着父亲去拜访过。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c8d5125464df0e61_s00069",
      "start_ms": 167520,
      "end_ms": 168140,
      "text": "钱学森，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c8d5125464df0e61_s00070",
      "start_ms": 168140,
      "end_ms": 168865,
      "text": "心里一动，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c8d5125464df0e61_s00071",
      "start_ms": 169310,
      "end_ms": 170835,
      "text": "提笔写了一封信，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c8d5125464df0e61_s00072",
      "start_ms": 171350,
      "end_ms": 173925,
      "text": "信上写着我准备归国，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c8d5125464df0e61_s00073",
      "start_ms": 174640,
      "end_ms": 176425,
      "text": "但美国处处阻挠，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c8d5125464df0e61_s00074",
      "start_ms": 176890,
      "end_ms": 178425,
      "text": "请求祖国帮助。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c8d5125464df0e61_s00075",
      "start_ms": 178990,
      "end_ms": 181245,
      "text": "信写好了怎么寄出去？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c8d5125464df0e61_s00076",
      "start_ms": 182620,
      "end_ms": 183295,
      "text": "这时候，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c8d5125464df0e61_s00077",
      "start_ms": 183820,
      "end_ms": 185595,
      "text": "他的夫人蒋英站了出来，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c8d5125464df0e61_s00078",
      "start_ms": 185990,
      "end_ms": 186790,
      "text": "蒋英是谁？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c8d5125464df0e61_s00079",
      "start_ms": 187050,
      "end_ms": 188125,
      "text": "著名歌唱家，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c8d5125464df0e61_s00080",
      "start_ms": 188490,
      "end_ms": 191535,
      "text": "他的父亲是民国著名军事家蒋百里，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c8d5125464df0e61_s00081",
      "start_ms": 192430,
      "end_ms": 194215,
      "text": "这位出身名门的女子，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c8d5125464df0e61_s00082",
      "start_ms": 194510,
      "end_ms": 197735,
      "text": "做了一件让后来无数人泪目的事，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c8d5125464df0e61_s00083",
      "start_ms": 198490,
      "end_ms": 203215,
      "text": "他用左手模仿小孩歪歪扭扭的笔迹，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c8d5125464df0e61_s00084",
      "start_ms": 203790,
      "end_ms": 204810,
      "text": "把信封写好，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c8d5125464df0e61_s00085",
      "start_ms": 205150,
      "end_ms": 209885,
      "text": "然后把那封求救信夹在了一封给妹妹的家书里。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c8d5125464df0e61_s00086",
      "start_ms": 210290,
      "end_ms": 213475,
      "text": "既往比利时妹妹一看就明白了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c8d5125464df0e61_s00087",
      "start_ms": 214190,
      "end_ms": 216375,
      "text": "立刻转继回祖国。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c8d5125464df0e61_s00088",
      "start_ms": 217710,
      "end_ms": 219925,
      "text": "这封信一路辗转，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c8d5125464df0e61_s00089",
      "start_ms": 220270,
      "end_ms": 223835,
      "text": "最后摆在了周总理的办公桌上家人们，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c8d5125464df0e61_s00090",
      "start_ms": 224250,
      "end_ms": 226185,
      "text": "您知道这封信有多重要吗？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c8d5125464df0e61_s00091",
      "start_ms": 226520,
      "end_ms": 226960,
      "text": "那会儿，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c8d5125464df0e61_s00092",
      "start_ms": 226960,
      "end_ms": 229315,
      "text": "中美正在日内瓦谈判，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c8d5125464df0e61_s00093",
      "start_ms": 230190,
      "end_ms": 233385,
      "text": "美国想换回十一个被俘的美军飞行员，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c8d5125464df0e61_s00094",
      "start_ms": 233880,
      "end_ms": 235055,
      "text": "嘴上却硬的很，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c8d5125464df0e61_s00095",
      "start_ms": 235550,
      "end_ms": 241195,
      "text": "说钱学森是自愿留在美国的中方代表当场把信拿出来，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c8d5125464df0e61_s00096",
      "start_ms": 241560,
      "end_ms": 242605,
      "text": "白纸黑字，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c8d5125464df0e61_s00097",
      "start_ms": 243010,
      "end_ms": 244105,
      "text": "铁证如山，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c8d5125464df0e61_s00098",
      "start_ms": 244780,
      "end_ms": 247545,
      "text": "美国人的脸当场就挂不住了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c8d5125464df0e61_s00099",
      "start_ms": 248420,
      "end_ms": 253200,
      "text": "最后双方达成交换十一个美军飞行员，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c8d5125464df0e61_s00100",
      "start_ms": 253500,
      "end_ms": 256375,
      "text": "换一个钱学森家人们，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c8d5125464df0e61_s00101",
      "start_ms": 256840,
      "end_ms": 258275,
      "text": "您算算这笔账，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c8d5125464df0e61_s00102",
      "start_ms": 258750,
      "end_ms": 260825,
      "text": "十一个飞行员换一个人，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c8d5125464df0e61_s00103",
      "start_ms": 261350,
      "end_ms": 263285,
      "text": "美国人心疼的是一个兵。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c8d5125464df0e61_s00104",
      "start_ms": 263740,
      "end_ms": 265240,
      "text": "可他们换出去的是谁？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c8d5125464df0e61_s00105",
      "start_ms": 265560,
      "end_ms": 267865,
      "text": "是抵得上五个师的钱学森。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c8d5125464df0e61_s00106",
      "start_ms": 268660,
      "end_ms": 271165,
      "text": "后来有美国人自己都承认，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c8d5125464df0e61_s00107",
      "start_ms": 271510,
      "end_ms": 277225,
      "text": "这笔买卖是他们在冷战里做过的最亏本的交易之一。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c8d5125464df0e61_s00108",
      "start_ms": 278950,
      "end_ms": 280935,
      "text": "一九五五年九月十七号，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c8d5125464df0e61_s00109",
      "start_ms": 281400,
      "end_ms": 284385,
      "text": "钱学森终于登上了回国的轮船，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c8d5125464df0e61_s00110",
      "start_ms": 284800,
      "end_ms": 287390,
      "text": "克利夫兰总统号船。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c8d5125464df0e61_s00111",
      "start_ms": 287450,
      "end_ms": 289690,
      "text": "经过日本横滨码头上，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c8d5125464df0e61_s00112",
      "start_ms": 289690,
      "end_ms": 292670,
      "text": "有人再三劝他下去逛逛嘛，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c8d5125464df0e61_s00113",
      "start_ms": 292750,
      "end_ms": 293885,
      "text": "买点土特产，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c8d5125464df0e61_s00114",
      "start_ms": 294790,
      "end_ms": 296785,
      "text": "钱学森一步都没有下船。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c8d5125464df0e61_s00115",
      "start_ms": 297270,
      "end_ms": 298275,
      "text": "据后来披露。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c8d5125464df0e61_s00116",
      "start_ms": 299020,
      "end_ms": 303780,
      "text": "组织上早就提前以他父亲的名义发来电报，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c8d5125464df0e61_s00117",
      "start_ms": 303800,
      "end_ms": 306340,
      "text": "叮嘱他沿途切勿下船。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c8d5125464df0e61_s00118",
      "start_ms": 307280,
      "end_ms": 307960,
      "text": "为什么？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c8d5125464df0e61_s00119",
      "start_ms": 308320,
      "end_ms": 310600,
      "text": "因为一旦踏上日本的土地，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c8d5125464df0e61_s00120",
      "start_ms": 310840,
      "end_ms": 313220,
      "text": "就什么意外都可能发生，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c8d5125464df0e61_s00121",
      "start_ms": 313660,
      "end_ms": 316700,
      "text": "而美国人可以说跟我们没关系。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c8d5125464df0e61_s00122",
      "start_ms": 318500,
      "end_ms": 319160,
      "text": "就这样，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c8d5125464df0e61_s00123",
      "start_ms": 319640,
      "end_ms": 323760,
      "text": "这艘船载着全中国最值钱的一个头脑，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c8d5125464df0e61_s00124",
      "start_ms": 324580,
      "end_ms": 325560,
      "text": "破浪向西。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c8d5125464df0e61_s00125",
      "start_ms": 326500,
      "end_ms": 328375,
      "text": "一九五五年十月八号，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c8d5125464df0e61_s00126",
      "start_ms": 328770,
      "end_ms": 331750,
      "text": "钱学森踏上祖国土地的那一刻，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c8d5125464df0e61_s00127",
      "start_ms": 332530,
      "end_ms": 336250,
      "text": "迎接他的是罗湖桥上的五星红旗。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c8d5125464df0e61_s00128",
      "start_ms": 336909,
      "end_ms": 337970,
      "text": "他后来回忆说，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c8d5125464df0e61_s00129",
      "start_ms": 338390,
      "end_ms": 339770,
      "text": "看到国旗那一刻，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c8d5125464df0e61_s00130",
      "start_ms": 340050,
      "end_ms": 341630,
      "text": "眼泪差点没绷住。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c8d5125464df0e61_s00131",
      "start_ms": 343330,
      "end_ms": 343930,
      "text": "家人们，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c8d5125464df0e61_s00132",
      "start_ms": 343930,
      "end_ms": 344530,
      "text": "您想想，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c8d5125464df0e61_s00133",
      "start_ms": 344530,
      "end_ms": 345330,
      "text": "那段日子，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c8d5125464df0e61_s00134",
      "start_ms": 345630,
      "end_ms": 346830,
      "text": "他被关了五年，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c8d5125464df0e61_s00135",
      "start_ms": 347290,
      "end_ms": 349890,
      "text": "瘦了三十斤受尽折磨，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c8d5125464df0e61_s00136",
      "start_ms": 350190,
      "end_ms": 353350,
      "text": "可他一句怨言都没有蒋英。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c8d5125464df0e61_s00137",
      "start_ms": 353370,
      "end_ms": 354250,
      "text": "后来回忆说，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c8d5125464df0e61_s00138",
      "start_ms": 354670,
      "end_ms": 355390,
      "text": "那五年，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c8d5125464df0e61_s00139",
      "start_ms": 355610,
      "end_ms": 357730,
      "text": "他甚至做好了最坏的打算，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c8d5125464df0e61_s00140",
      "start_ms": 358230,
      "end_ms": 359785,
      "text": "但但他们始终相信，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c8d5125464df0e61_s00141",
      "start_ms": 360260,
      "end_ms": 362255,
      "text": "祖国一定会接他回家。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c8d5125464df0e61_s00142",
      "start_ms": 363370,
      "end_ms": 364165,
      "text": "事实证明，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c8d5125464df0e61_s00143",
      "start_ms": 364470,
      "end_ms": 365595,
      "text": "他们赌赢了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c8d5125464df0e61_s00144",
      "start_ms": 366560,
      "end_ms": 369525,
      "text": "而中国赢回了自己的未来。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c8d5125464df0e61_s00145",
      "start_ms": 370470,
      "end_ms": 371530,
      "text": "有一句话说的好，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c8d5125464df0e61_s00146",
      "start_ms": 371810,
      "end_ms": 374395,
      "text": "有些历史我们不该忘，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c8d5125464df0e61_s00147",
      "start_ms": 374720,
      "end_ms": 375535,
      "text": "也不能忘。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c8d5125464df0e61_s00148",
      "start_ms": 376580,
      "end_ms": 382450,
      "text": "钱学森用五年自由换回了中国航天整整一个时代。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c8d5125464df0e61_s00149",
      "start_ms": 382530,
      "end_ms": 386385,
      "text": "今天的神州嫦娥天问、东风快递，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c8d5125464df0e61_s00150",
      "start_ms": 386940,
      "end_ms": 392905,
      "text": "所有的根都从他一九五五年迈上罗浮桥那一刻开始，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c8d5125464df0e61_s00151",
      "start_ms": 393890,
      "end_ms": 395585,
      "text": "家人们点个关注，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c8d5125464df0e61_s00152",
      "start_ms": 395910,
      "end_ms": 399475,
      "text": "下期我接着讲钱老回国之后的故事。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c8d5125464df0e61_s00153",
      "start_ms": 399910,
      "end_ms": 404025,
      "text": "这条视频请您一定点赞、收藏、转发，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c8d5125464df0e61_s00154",
      "start_ms": 404550,
      "end_ms": 405830,
      "text": "让更多人知道，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c8d5125464df0e61_s00155",
      "start_ms": 406010,
      "end_ms": 412405,
      "text": "当年有一个中国人用一封藏在信封里的求救信救回了自己的祖国。"
    }
  ],
